# Memory Bank Rule

At every new work block, read:

- `memory_bank/context.md`
- `memory_bank/progress.md`
- `memory_bank/decisions.md`

After successful Verification of a scoped task, update
`memory_bank/progress.md` with completed work, checks and known follow-ups.
Add an ADR-style entry to `memory_bank/decisions.md` only for an accepted
decision affecting architecture, provider choice, strategy behavior or
deployment assumptions. Do not mark unverified work as complete.

When the Owner supplies durable project facts, record them only in the relevant
project memory file and only within the approved documentation scope.
